Third-party components
----------------------

This project runs, but does not redistribute, several independent projects that
carry their own licenses:

  * SearXNG          (https://github.com/searxng/searxng)        AGPL-3.0
  * Supabase         (https://github.com/supabase/supabase)      Apache-2.0
  * pgvector         (https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector)      PostgreSQL
  * Harrier-OSS      (https://huggingface.co/microsoft)          MIT
  * Qwen3-Reranker   (https://huggingface.co/Qwen)               Apache-2.0

The model weights are downloaded at runtime and are not part of this
distribution. SearXNG is used as a network service via its HTTP API and its
image is pulled from its own registry; it is not linked into or distributed
with this software.

Dependencies installed from npm and PyPI carry their own licenses, recorded in
the respective package manifests and lockfiles.
